| ***Amendment: v2.3 → v2.4 — Databricks-free platform cascade aligned to Application Architecture Specification v3.6, plus version-reference corrections per Specification Consistency & Errata Report v1.0. Changes in this amendment: Section 1.1 — Architecture status updated to v3.6 and to the Azure-only platform summary (Azure PostgreSQL Flexible Server, Azure App Service, Azure Functions); all specification status and version references refreshed to current versions (Security v1.4, UX/UI v1.5, Data Integration v1.6, In-Application Notification Mechanism Specification v1.1, Workforce Planning v1.1, System Context and Domain Glossary v1.11). The Databricks-based Azure migration specification is withdrawn; the canonical migration specification is OBS_Azure_Cloud_Migration_Specification_v2_0. Section 4 — Document library and related-document version references updated for the cascade. Section 8 — Document control: v2.4 and errata rows added. Historical Document Control rows and open-item resolution narratives describing past events are unchanged.*** |
